Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:46:18 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 23/25] fix(ui): apply Eprisi font-family to shadcn
 Button/Input/Tabs primitives

Tailwind's fontFamily.sans/heading were already configured in
apps/meteor/tailwind.config.ts (GATE 3), but no component ever applied
the resulting ep-font-sans utility class. Browsers don't inherit
font-family into <button>/<input> by default, so the GATE 4 login
screens' buttons and inputs silently rendered in the browser's native
control font (computed font-family: Arial) instead of IBM Plex Sans.

Adds ep-font-sans to both local shadcn Button copies (apps/meteor +
web-ui-registration), both Input copies, and TabsTrigger. Verified via
computed style against the live dev server.
